00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.330
Parlons d'un incident réel.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:23.570
Une entreprise

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.330
a déployé un flux

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.390
